# Tenuous Existence (abyssea 170): a level 99 Warrior in La Theine Plateau with Heart of Madness completed and the
# quest accepted (GMs). Section 1 wants the hour from 18:00 to 4:59 (user ruling 2026-11-04, kept Lua bugs: the Lua's
# VanadielHour() >= 18 and VanadielHour() < 5 was never true; the C# reads it as an `or`): qm3 at 12:00 plays its
# default (STRANGE_ENERGY); at 20:00 12, finished: Prog 1; at 04:00 12 again (section 1 reads no Prog), Prog 1 again.
# To Port Jeuno: Joachim at Prog 1: 336, finished: completed, Champions of Abyssea accepted. A GM's Prog 1 on the
# completed quest; Joachim: Champions of Abyssea has no section (no maw quest completed): his script's 328, twice.
lists LaTheinePlateau/qm3/onTrigger PortJeuno/Joachim/onTrigger PortJeuno/onEventFinish/336 PortJeuno/onEventFinish/328
char zone=LaTheinePlateau pos=-177.5,8,254 job=WAR lvl=99
quest Abyssea.AJourneyBegins completed
quest Abyssea.TheTruthBeckons completed
quest Abyssea.DawnOfDeath completed
quest Abyssea.FirstContact completed
quest Abyssea.AnOfficerAndAPirate completed
quest Abyssea.HeartOfMadness completed
quest Abyssea.TenuousExistence accepted
login
trigger qm3                             # 12:00: no section (outside 18:00 to 4:59): STRANGE_ENERGY (default)
finish-if-event
wait vana=8                             # 20:00: VanadielHour() >= 18
trigger qm3                             # 12
finish-if-event                         # Prog 1
wait vana=8                             # 04:00: VanadielHour() < 5
trigger qm3                             # 12 again
finish-if-event                         # Prog 1
warp -51.344,0,-9.978 PortJeuno
trigger Joachim                         # Prog 1: 336
finish                                  # completed; Champions of Abyssea accepted
charvar Quest[8][170]Prog 1             # a GM: Prog 1 on the completed quest
trigger Joachim                         # Champions of Abyssea, no maw quest: 328
finish
trigger Joachim                         # 328 again
finish
